{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/4892","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/4892/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/4892/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/4892/events","html_url":"https://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/issues/4892","id":45907848,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU0NTkwNzg0OA==","number":4892,"title":"Failing TableTest after Model baking","user":{"login":"oldskool","id":567664,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2NzY2NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/567664?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/oldskool","html_url":"https://github.com/oldskool","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oldskool/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oldskool/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oldskool/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oldskool/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oldskool/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oldskool/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oldskool/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oldskool/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oldskool/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":60504544,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw2MDUwNDU0NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/labels/defect","name":"defect","color":"e50f2c","default":false,"description":""},{"id":60507596,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw2MDUwNzU5Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/labels/console","name":"console","color":"FFFFFF","default":false,"description":null},{"id":60525626,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw2MDUyNTYyNg==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/labels/need%20more%20info","name":"need more info","color":"eb6420","default":false,"description":""}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/milestones/7","html_url":"https://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/milestone/7","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/milestones/7/labels","id":453043,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lNDUzMDQz","number":7,"title":"3.0.0","description":"New major release that breaks compatibility with 2.x\r\n\r\n- PHP5.4.19+\r\n- New ORM & behaviors.\r\n- Improved Routing\r\n- PSR-0 and composer support.\r\n- Simpler configuration and bootstrapping.\r\n- Improved configuration handling.\r\n- Improved bake.\r\n\r\nSee [the roadmap](http://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/wiki/3.0-roadmap) for more details.","creator":null,"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":2464,"state":"closed","created_at":"2013-10-11T20:56:23Z","updated_at":"2015-12-17T03:00:48Z","due_on":"2015-03-22T04:00:00Z","closed_at":"2015-03-23T01:02:41Z"},"comments":2,"created_at":"2014-10-15T19:27:46Z","updated_at":"2014-10-18T02:53:08Z","closed_at":"2014-10-18T02:53:08Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"By default, when baking a Model, the test files for both the Entity and Table classes are baked along with it. Although, the generated tests for the Table class fail by default:\n\n> There were 2 failures:\n> \n> 1) Warning\n> No tests found in class \"Cake3App\\Test\\TestCase\\Model\\Table\\ProductCategoriesTableTest\".\n> \n> 2) Warning\n> No tests found in class \"Cake3App\\Test\\TestCase\\Model\\Table\\ProductsTableTest\".\n> \n> FAILURES!  \n> Tests: 12, Assertions: 0, Failures: 2, Incomplete: 10.\n\nOnly the `setUp()` and `tearDown()` methods are baked into the test file, but nothing else, causing the test to fail immediately after baking.\n\nSince the Table objects by default come with a `initialize()` and `validationDefault()` method, I'm wondering why there are no \"dummy\" tests for that like for Controller tests? Something like:\n\n``` php\npublic function testValidationDefault() {\n    $this->markTestIncomplete('testValidationDefault not implemented.');\n}\n```\n\nThis would be sufficient to not have the tests fail, but just throw a \"OK, but incomplete, skipped, or risky tests!\" warning instead.\n","closed_by":{"login":"markstory","id":24086,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MDg2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24086?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory","html_url":"https://github.com/markstory","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/4892/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/4892/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}